## Summary
CNN and Variety are partnering again for exclusive live Emmy Awards red carpet pre-show coverage, following their successful collaboration during last year's Oscars season.

## Key Points
- CNN and Variety will deliver exclusive live pre-show coverage from the red carpet of the 78th Emmy Awards
- This follows a successful partnership during last awards season covering the Oscars
- Previous collaboration included 'Actors on Actors' and a town hall with Timothée Chalamet
- CNN correspondent Elizabeth will be involved in the Emmy coverage


